	(text "RP2354B core. Follows Raspberry Pi 'Hardware design with RP2350' (Aug 2026) and Proton Rev4.\nNo external flash: the RP2354B has 2 MB in package, so QSPI SD0-SD3 and SCLK stay unconnected.\nQSPI_SS keeps only the BOOTSEL path through 1k, as the guide requires.\nRegulator: L1 and capacitor values follow the guide. Inductor polarity dot matters.\nDEVIATION: the team requires 0603 minimum, so C1-C3 and R3 are 0603 where the guide uses 0402; see report.\nR_XTAL 1k and 15 pF are tuned for ABM8-272-T3 at 3.3 V. Do not substitute the crystal.\nR1/R2 (27R) sit close to the MCU per the guide. GP21 has CLOCK GPOUT0 for optional MCLK."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3fcc0e1a-3925-5aec-8e60-ef378759576a")
	)
)
